WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.910
The thin blue line.

00:02.610 --> 00:06.300
Everything we call weather happens inside that blue line.

00:06.750 --> 00:17.333
Three quarters of the air is in the first eleven kilometres, a layer so thin that on a globe the size of a football it would be about as thick as two sheets of paper.

00:17.783 --> 00:20.021
It is the only air there is.
